From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dariusz Majnert <dariusz.majnert@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:11:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] hal: raise HAL_NAME_LEN to 55

Match the name length LinuxCNC 2.10 uses, so longer HAL names, including
thread names with descriptive statistic suffixes, fit. The name length is
part of the HAL shared-memory layout, so bump HAL_VER to refuse mixed
builds.
---
 docs/src/hal/general-ref.adoc | 2 +-
 src/hal/hal.h                 | 2 +-
 src/hal/hal_priv.h            | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/src/hal/general-ref.adoc b/docs/src/hal/general-ref.adoc
index 5640eb29e8..2bf567ba64 100644
--- a/docs/src/hal/general-ref.adoc
+++ b/docs/src/hal/general-ref.adoc
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
 
 (((HAL Entity Names)))
 All HAL entities are accessible and manipulable by their names, so documenting the names of pins, signals, parameters, etc., is very important.
-Names in HAL have a maximum length of 41 characters (as defined by HAL_NAME_LEN in hal.h).
+Names in HAL have a maximum length of 55 characters (as defined by HAL_NAME_LEN in hal.h).
 Many names will be presented in the general form, with formatted text _<like-this>_ representing fields of various values.
 
 When pins, signals, or parameters are described for the first time, their name will be preceded by their type in parentheses (_float_) and followed by a brief description.
diff --git a/src/hal/hal.h b/src/hal/hal.h
index fb67a33d3c..88bfc9556a 100644
--- a/src/hal/hal.h
+++ b/src/hal/hal.h
@@ -136,7 +136,7 @@ RTAPI_BEGIN_DECLS
 
 #include "rtapi_errno.h"
 
-#define HAL_NAME_LEN     47	/* length for pin, signal, etc, names */
+#define HAL_NAME_LEN     55	/* length for pin, signal, etc, names */
 
 /** These locking codes define the state of HAL locking, are used by most functions */
 /** The functions locked will return a -EPERM error message **/
diff --git a/src/hal/hal_priv.h b/src/hal/hal_priv.h
index 1bb7d08044..708eb9511d 100644
--- a/src/hal/hal_priv.h
+++ b/src/hal/hal_priv.h
@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@
 */
 
 #define HAL_KEY   0x48414C32	/* key used to open HAL shared memory */
-#define HAL_VER   0x00000010	/* version code */
+#define HAL_VER   0x00000011	/* version code */
 #define HAL_SIZE  (256*4096)
 #define HAL_PSEUDO_COMP_PREFIX "__" /* prefix to identify a pseudo component */
 
